{"D:\\wt\\ssimple4\\vlog\\ssimple4\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "This is my mother at 62 in her first calligraphy class in Osaka, holding a brush for the first time since she was a little girl. Everybody in that room was younger than her. She lived to 101. After 60, most people start stopping things. My mother did the opposite. She started 9 new things, one by one, and she kept every single one of them for almost 40 years. Today I will tell you all 9. And number nine is the reason she was never lonely, not even at a hundred, when every friend her own age was already gone. One of them she did every school morning at a street corner, in a green armband, for twenty-two years. Another one cost her one coin a day, and at New Year it made eleven grandchildren run to her door. But first, one honest thing. I cannot promise you a hundred and one. Nobody can. This is not advice from a clinic.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.22, "e": 0.4}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.54}, {"w": " mother", "s": 0.54, "e": 0.84}, {"w": " at", "s": 0.84, "e": 1.18}, {"w": " 62", "s": 1.18, "e": 1.82}, {"w": " in", "s": 1.82, "e": 2.48}, {"w": " her", "s": 2.48, "e": 2.62}, {"w": " first", "s": 2.62, "e": 3.04}, {"w": " calligraphy", "s": 3.04, "e": 3.66}, {"w": " class", "s": 3.66, "e": 3.98}, {"w": " in", "s": 3.98, "e": 4.16}, {"w": " Osaka,", "s": 4.16, "e": 5.24}, {"w": " holding", "s": 5.24, "e": 5.44}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.44, "e": 5.64}, {"w": " brush", "s": 5.64, "e": 5.98}, {"w": " for", "s": 5.98, "e": 6.14}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.14, "e": 6.26}, {"w": " first", "s": 6.26, "e": 6.64}, {"w": " time", "s": 6.38, "e": 7.02}, {"w": " since", "s": 7.02, "e": 7.26}, {"w": " she", "s": 7.26, "e": 7.4}, {"w": " was", "s": 7.4, "e": 7.6}, {"w": " a", "s": 7.6, "e": 7.76}, {"w": " little", "s": 7.76, "e": 7.92}, {"w": " girl.", "s": 7.92, "e": 8.98}, {"w": " Everybody", "s": 8.76, "e": 9.48}, {"w": " in", "s": 9.48, "e": 9.74}, {"w": " that", "s": 9.74, "e": 9.