 send a quick message on the phone and forget it in one minute. A letter, she said. Somebody keeps. I still have 140 of her letters. Every one starts the same way, with the weather in Osaka. Write one letter this Sunday.", "words": [{"w": " Every", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " Sunday", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.76}, {"w": " afternoon,", "s": 0.76, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " after", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.96}, {"w": " lunch,", "s": 1.96, "e": 2.9}, {"w": " she", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.0}, {"w": " sat", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.26}, {"w": " at", "s": 3.26, "e": 3.44}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.44, "e": 3.6}, {"w": " low", "s": 3.6, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " table", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.2}, {"w": " with", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.52}, {"w": " her", "s": 4.52, "e": 4.64}, {"w": " good", "s": 4.64, "e": 4.9}, {"w": " pen", "s": 4.9, "e": 5.32}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.32, "e": 5.78}, {"w": " wrote", "s": 5.78, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.36}, {"w": " letter", "s": 6.36, "e": 6.7}, {"w": " by", "s": 6.7, "e": 6.92}, {"w": " hand.", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.4}, {"w": " To", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.72}, {"w": " me,", "s": 7.72, "e": 8.26}, {"w": " far", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.64}, {"w": " away.", "s": 8.64, "e": 8.96}, {"w": " To", "s": 8.96, "e": 9.54}, {"w": " my", "s": 9.54, "e": 9.72}, {"w": " brothers.", "s": 9.72, "e": 10.66}, {"w": " To", "s": 10.66, "e": 10.76}, {"w": " a", "s": 10.76, "e": 10.9}, {"w": " cousin", "s": 10.9, "e": 11.26}, {"w": " in", "s": 11.26, "e": 11.46}, {"w": " the", "s": 11.46, "e": 11.6}, {"w": " countryside.", "s": 11.6, "e": 12.7}, {"w": " To", "s": 12.7, "e": 12.78}, {"w": " her", "s": 12.78, "e": 12.96}, {"w": " old", "s": 12.96, "e": 13.26}, {"w": " teacher.", "s": 13.26, "e": 14.16}, {"w": " To", "s": 14.16, "e": 14.26}, {"w": " a", "s": 14.26, "e": 14.42}, {"w": " neighbor", "s": 14.42, "e": 14.72}, {"w": " who", "s": 14.72, "e": 14.94}, {"w": " moved", "s": 14.94, "e": 15.22}, {"w": " away.", "s": 15.22, "e": 16.12}, {"w": " One", "s": 16.24, "e": 16.46}, {"w": " letter,", "s": 16.46, "e": 17.